            "detailed_description": "Shape Palette is a 2D puzzle game that offers simple gameplay which builds with each stage introducing new rules &amp; challenges. Place, combine, splash &amp; maneuver around obstacles in numerous shape-bending puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.poster.avif?t=1675810535\" width=666 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.webm?t=1675810535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.mp4?t=1675810535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Focus On Puzzle Solving With Minimal &amp; Simple Visuals<br></li><li>Play 49 Different Hand Crafted Levels<br></li><li>Evolving Game Mechanics Including Combining, Splashing &amp; Various Shape Types<br></li><li>Play Entirely With A Mouse!<br></li><li>Colourblind Mode To Support Users With Vision Difficulties<br></li><li>Difficulty Ramping Including Challenging Bonus Levels</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Shape Palette is a 2D puzzle game that offers simple gameplay which builds with each stage introducing new rules &amp; challenges. Place, combine, splash &amp; maneuver around obstacles in numerous shape-bending puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.poster.avif?t=1675810535\" width=666 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.webm?t=1675810535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730160/extras/b8d37d6d5a7306d3198a18407276f101.mp4?t=1675810535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Focus On Puzzle Solving With Minimal &amp; Simple Visuals<br></li><li>Play 49 Different Hand Crafted Levels<br></li><li>Evolving Game Mechanics Including Combining, Splashing &amp; Various Shape Types<br></li><li>Play Entirely With A Mouse!<br></li><li>Colourblind Mode To Support Users With Vision Difficulties<br></li><li>Difficulty Ramping Including Challenging Bonus Levels</li></ul>",
